    },
    {
      "id": "05b5bba2-cd0f-4eb4-8352-776c4481b856",
      "index": 98,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "Security C-SMIC Restricted",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a53ad2a5-1123-4da2-92f4-d69b9c89a9ce",
      "index": 99,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "2",
      "content": "4.2 Effective period of TECN",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8e69cc73-7a1c-4751-8662-640dc646c84d",
      "index": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1. Document format should follow the requirements sign-off\n2. Document sign-off should follow the requirements in item 20\n3. Document access authority should follow the requirements in item 18.2\n4. Document effectiveness cycle time should be within 14 working days",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5065b23d-a035-4383-a687-b4d991927251",
      "index": 101,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "2",
      "content": "4.3 All documents generated by function departments should be named according to the below-mentioned categories of documents for example,”SMIC Document Control Procedure” Document title naming rules are follows:",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "73403d44-aef2-4257-a72d-b75b52294cf3",
      "index": 102,
      "type": "title",
      "level": "3",
      "content": "4.3.1 FAB documents",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "2c05da77-7b79-4df3-ba6b-a1fcecda89cd",
      "index": 103,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "1. Equipment operation instruction",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "96230590-902f-4eee-8de7-f4685dbd082a",
      "index": 104,
      "type": "table",
      "level": null,
      "content": "<table><tr><td><p><strong>Document Scope</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Naming Rule Format</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p>200mm Fab</p><p>SMIC 200mm XXX(Module)XXX(Equipment/System Name)O.I.E.g SMIC 200mm ETCH LAM</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>ALL Fab :Moduleis operational</p></td><td><p>SMIC XXX(Module)XXX(Equipment/System Name)O.I.E.g SMIC LITHO Entegris XCDA PM O.I.</p></td></tr></table>",
      "page_num": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "231c6249-58c3-4370-a966-89070318a83d",
      "index": 105,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "2. Other documents",
